{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o062a","title":"史涣曹仁在犬城斩眭固","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o062a-account","label":"正文","text":"曹操遣史涣、曹仁渡河；眭固北迎袁绍求救，途中与二将交战，被击败斩杀。","evidence":["wudi-e-o062a-q"]},{"id":"gongsuntao-a-6439762c446a4ab1b948","label":"正文","text":"眭固杀杨丑欲北合袁绍太祖遣史涣破斩之","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-f3d13d4c430c2aebb31a"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"遣军","evidence":["wudi-e-o062a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0158","role":"交战","evidence":["wudi-e-o062a-q"]},{"person":"cao-ren","role":"交战","evidence":["wudi-e-o062a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0082","role":"战败被杀","evidence":["wudi-e-o062a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0052","role":"求援对象","evidence":["wudi-e-o062a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0157","role":"被杀","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-f3d13d4c430c2aebb31a"]}],"place":{"text":"犬城","evidence":["wudi-e-o062a-q"]},"time":{"label":"建安四年夏四月","year":199,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o062a-q","wudi-q-o061","wudi-q-b-51bced16741add42ff70"],"chronology":"wudi-y199","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o061","basis":"建安四年夏四月","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,360,"O062a"],"order":158}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"cao-ren","name":"曹仁","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0052","name":"袁绍","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0082","name":"眭固","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0157","name":"杨丑","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0158","name":"史涣","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"gongsuntao-q-f3d13d4c430c2aebb31a","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-e96ffada202f222baadb","layer":"original","quote":"杨将眭固杀丑，将其众，欲北合袁绍。太祖遣史涣邀击，破之于犬城，斩固，尽收其众也","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":147,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":12,"end":51,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o062a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-01656b554fda06a0ac10","layer":"original","quote":"夏四月，进军临河，使史涣、曹仁渡河击之〖5〗。固使杨故长史薛洪、河内太守缪尚留守〖6〗，自将兵北迎绍求救。与涣、仁相遇犬城〖7〗，交战；大破之，斩固。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":359,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":75,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-51bced16741add42ff70","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-51bced16741add42ff70","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗四年：建安四年（公元 199）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":369,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-20628d34a709162c77f0","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o061","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-502d4e8c0ed143eaa30d","layer":"original","quote":"四年春二月〖1〗，公还至昌邑〖2〗。张杨将杨丑杀杨〖3〗。眭固又杀丑，以其众属袁绍，屯射犬〖4〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":358,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":49,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
